<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink176-kilavi">
       talaimakaḷum tōḻiyum oruṅkuniṉṟuḻi ivaḷ eṉṉaivaruttutaṟkuc ceyta tavaṟu eṉ eṉṟu viṉāya talaimakaṟkut tōḻi nakaiyāṭic colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
           Spoken in jest by the confidante to the heroine, when the heroine and confidante were standing together, as [the hero] asked 'What is the mistake I made for her to make me suffer?'</p>
  </div> 
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink177">
<l>tavaṟila rāyiṉum paṉippa maṉṟa</l>
<l>vivaṟutirai tiḷaikku miṭumaṇa ṉeṭuṅkōṭṭu</l>
<l>muṇṭaka naṟumalar kamaḻun</l>
<l>toṇṭi yaṉṉō ṭōḷuṟ ṟōrē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>Those who had the shoulders of her who is like Toṇṭi</l>
        <l>In which the fragrant blossoms of the Muṇṭakam tree emit fragrance</l>
        <l>Upon the long curve [= shore] where which sand is deposited,</l>
        <l>Where increasing waves bubble;</l>
        <l>Even though they are without mistake, they suffer indeed!</l>
              </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
